{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415041","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415041","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041504101:1":{"text":"너는 성가신 상대긴 하지만 아직 그렇게 대단한 존재는 아니다.","source_cn":"你是难缠的对手，但你还不够格成为那万中无一。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B02E70D7FCA336","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041504102:1":{"text":"흥, 죽음의 함대의 함장. 나에게 두목에 대해 가르치려고 드는 건가?","source_cn":"哼，死潮舰队的舰长，竟然想教我怎么做老大？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9240A0ED6CD0BFEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041504103:1":{"text":"웃기지도 않는군. 우리가 친구라도 된 거라고 생각하나?","source_cn":"真稀奇，我们好像不是朋友吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A91B665107AD277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041504104:1":{"text":"왜? 너는 나에게 감사해야 하지 않나? 테시오는 내가 쓰다 버린 체스말일 뿐이야. 네가 그를 체스보드에서 쫓아내 버렸지.","source_cn":"怎么，你不应该感谢我吗？泰西欧是被我抛弃的无用棋子，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9A0028CE64F5B59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041504105:1":{"text":"네 동생 나라도 마찬가지야. 내가 바닷속에 가라앉은 그녀를 부르지 않았다면... 지금쯤 다른 시체들처럼 진흙 속에 묻혀있지 않았을까?","source_cn":"还有奈拉，如果不是我唤醒了海底的她……她到现在都和其他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0F3B6D03A28CE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041504106:1":{"text":"동생과 아버지를 버리고 그 자리에 앉은 네가 나에게 감사해야 할 것 같은데.","source_cn":"抛弃了妹妹和父亲坐上这个位置的你，难道不应该感谢我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E0A7FE5509F8DD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041504107:1":{"text":"나에게 고맙다고 해보시지, 소니아!","source_cn":"感谢我吧！索尼娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED2612F129DE65A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041504108:1":{"text":"너와 나는 어쩌면 같은 사람일지도 모르겠군, 하하하하!","source_cn":"你和我，也许才是同类，哈哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25DA9866BE36C883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041504109:1":{"text":"아니... 나는 당신과 달라.","source_cn":"不……我和你不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8F37408D90242C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041504110:1":{"text":"당신은 힘 외에 가진 것이 없지.","source_cn":"你除了力量，一无所有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEDC03957E85063C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041504111:1":{"text":"심지어 그 힘조차 다른 곳에서 훔친 것 아닌가?","source_cn":"就连你的力量，也是你从别处窃取的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1773A764162F6922","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041504112:1":{"text":"힘은 힘이지. 내게 도움이 된다면 출처가 무슨 상관이지?","source_cn":"力量就是力量，只要能为我所用，出处毫无意义！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B426D88B5AFFF91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041504113:1":{"text":"나는 러스트 항에서 당신과 같은 자들을 많이 보았어.","source_cn":"我在锈锚港见过很多你这样的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB857FCDD3BA5F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041504114:1":{"text":"힘으로 모든 것을 통제하겠다는 망상의 끝은... 힘의 꼭두각시지.","source_cn":"妄想通过力量掌控一切……最终都变成了力量的傀儡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB18263A426655EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041504115:1":{"text":"꼭두각시가 뭐 어쨌다는 거지? 모든 자보다 강하면 그게 또 어떻다는 거냐. 내가 무적인 것을!","source_cn":"傀儡又如何，只要足够强，比任何人都要强！我就是那万中无一！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEC75A48BDBBD6A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041504116:1":{"text":"구제 불능이군.","source_cn":"你已经没救了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF55D73A81E69B965","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041504117:1":{"text":"하하하하, 소니아! 나는 네가 강자인 줄 알았어.","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈，索尼娅，我还以为你是强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x242CB83865FD066A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041504118:1":{"text":"하지만 그 말투는, 지금 감히 나를 동정하는 건가?","source_cn":"但瞧你对我说话的语气，你竟然在悲悯我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x969CEA4B06D1CE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041504119:1":{"text":"약자 주제에 감히 강자를 동정해? 웃기지도 않는군!","source_cn":"弱者竟敢悲悯强者？多可笑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD9E20F75C7C774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041504120:1":{"text":"여기가 불사호라면 뱃머리에 이미 네 목을 걸어뒀을 거다.","source_cn":"要是我还在不死号上，你的头已经被我挂在船头了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE6025F0B6D70C22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041504121:1":{"text":"당신은 죽음과 고통으로 남을 겁주려고 하지. 그건 당신이 항상 공포 속에 살고 있기 때문 아닌가?","source_cn":"你用死亡和折磨来恐吓别人，不就是因为你一直生活在这种恐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B254EA935138807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041504122:1":{"text":"호드킨, 내 앞에서 강한 척할 필요 없다. 이미 다 알고 있으니까.","source_cn":"霍德希金，你不必在我面前自诩强者。你早就暴露了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77C7954CBA54A051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041504123:1":{"text":"너는 그저 공포 속에서 사는 우스꽝스러운 광대일 뿐이야.","source_cn":"你只是一直生活在恐惧中的小丑而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3B429A77BF142C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1041504124:1":{"text":"흥... 말만 번지르르 한 건 의미가 없지.","source_cn":"哼……嘴皮子功夫再厉害也没有意义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335F5CEE6C120DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1041504125:1":{"text":"아픈 곳을 찔렀나? 미안. 내가 워낙 솔직해서 말이야.","source_cn":"戳到了你的痛处吗？真抱歉，我向来不喜欢绕弯子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DB23F243876E11A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1041504126:1":{"text":"듣기 싫다면 귀찮게 굴지 말던가.","source_cn":"不想听，那就别来打扰我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90C3C1FBE4AEE192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1041504127:1":{"text":"잊지 마. 당신 손에는 아직 블러디 로즈 형제들의 피가 묻어있다는 사실을!","source_cn":"别忘了，你的手上还沾着我血薇帮兄弟的血！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C0F405DDECC3ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1041504128:1":{"text":"그리고 당신과 나는 영원히 같을 수 없다는 사실을!","source_cn":"记住，我和你永远不是一路人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE27453378C9A0BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:霍德希金":{"text":"호드킨","source":"霍德希金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":29,"localized_text_count":28,"speaker_count":2}}